  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core Support to HRFT 2015-2019 - Evaluation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">avskaffande av Tortyr i Turkiet 2015-2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">HRFT syftar till en st&#xE4;rkt Turkisk efterlevnad av &#xE5;taganden inom r&#xE4;tten till frihet fr&#xE5;n tortyr och annan om&#xE4;nsklig behandling och till &#xF6;kat v&#xE4;lm&#xE5;ende f&#xF6;r tortyroffer. Detta f&#xF6;rv&#xE4;ntas uppn&#xE5;s genom fortsatt behandling av personer som utsatts f&#xF6;r tortyr, utveckling och f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttring av behandlingsmetoder, genom st&#xE4;rkande av ansvarsutkr&#xE4;vande och f&#xF6;rebyggande mekanismer i Turkiet, genom att utveckla metoder f&#xF6;r att hantera sociala trauman.

 

?</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Human Rights Foundation of Turkey (HRFT) shall engage in medical  rehabilitation of torture victims as well as strive towards increased accountability for perpetrators</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of HRFT with this contribution are:
&quot;Torture Survivors and Their Relatives Achieve a State Of Complete Physical, Psychological And Social Well-Being&quot;&#xA0;
&quot;Accountability for Torture and Other Forms Of Ill-Treatment is Achieved&quot;
&quot;Preventive Measures Against Torture And Other Forms Of Ill-Treatment In Turkey are Improved And Brought In Line With International Human Rights Norms&quot;
&quot;A Holistic Programme is Produced For Coping With On-Going Social Trauma Caused By Gross/Serious Human Rights Violations&quot;
&quot;Sustainable And Effective Programmes for Prevention Of Gross/Serious Human Rights Violations Are Developed At International Level&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
